      "text": "// Map of grade to average eco score (adjust values as appropriate)\nval gradeToAvgEcoScore \u003d Map(\n  \"A\" -\u003e 85,\n  \"B\" -\u003e 75,\n  \"C\" -\u003e 62,\n  \"D\" -\u003e 47,\n  \"E\" -\u003e 30,\n)\n// this variable should be used by spark udfs which means we need to broadcast it \nval gradeToAvgEcoScoreBroadcast \u003d spark.sparkContext.broadcast(gradeToAvgEcoScore)",
