      "text": "%spark\n// Try to build a udf that assign a null ecoscore the appropriate range scale\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.udf\n\ndef grade_to_score(grade:String,score:Int):Int\u003d{\n    if ((grade !\u003dnull)\u0026\u0026((score \u003d\u003d null) || (score \u003c 0))) {gradeToAvgEcoScoreBroadcast.value.getOrElse(grade,0)}\n    else score\n}\n",
